      "text": "Seven days shall ye eat unleavened bread, Ex. 12:15. neither shall there be leaven seen with thee, Ex. 13:7. not offer the blood of my sacrifice with leaven, Ex. 34:25 (Lev. 2:11). It shall not be baken with leaven, Lev. 6:17 (23:17). Thou shalt eat no leavened bread with it, Deut. 16:3. offer a sacrifice of thanksgiving with leaven, Amos 4:5.",
